OL,3,GNEWSADrivers racing before mum and
OL,4,Achild killed - trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitnesses have described seeing two
OL,7,Fdrivers racing and weaving their cars
OL,8,Fin and out of traffic at high speeds
OL,9,Fmoments before a crash which killed a
OL,10,Fmother and daughter.
OL,12,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and four-year-old
OL,13,FLena Czepczor were fatally struck by an
OL,14,FAudi TT on the pavement on Scott Hall
OL,15,FRoad in Leeds while walking to nursery
OL,16,Fon 16 January 2023.
OL,18,FJasskamal Riyat, 37, who was driving a
OL,19,FBMW 1 Series closely behind the Audi,
OL,20,Fis on trial at Leeds Crown Court
OL,21,Fcharged with causing their deaths by
OL,22,Fdangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
