OL,3,GNEWSADrivers racing before mum and
OL,4,Achild killed - trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FWitness Uel Knight told the court on
OL,7,FTuesday: "Both cars went past me at
OL,8,Fabout 50 to 70 miles per hour [80km/h
OL,9,Fto 113km/h]. Obviously they were
OL,10,Fracing."
